{"2633330": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Good Plague", "steam_appid": 2633330, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "The Good Plague is a party game to have fun with friends and family, taking place in an imaginary medieval kingdom contaminated by the plague.<br><br>Play as one of four characters desperately trying to flee the country : <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The Bard<br></li><li>The Thief<br></li><li>The Plague Doctor<br></li><li>The Warrior</li></ul><br>Everyone has his own backstory, perks and disadvantages to aid during the game.<br><br>In order to win, you will have to triumph over the challenges that await during this hazardous journey.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Board:</h2>The game board consists of different Points of Interest where you will have to choose where to go in order to earn some money or heal yourself.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2633330/extras/0a55d85a6f721cf63151fc52d1358bbe.avif?t=1718878554\" width=480 height=251 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mini-games:</h2>After each board phase, challenge your opponents in an array of minigames which defines who will play first during the next board phase.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Objets:</h2>Between each board and minigames phase, you have the possibility to spend your money and buy items.<br>These will aid in your journey or allow you to hinder your opponents.", "about_the_game": "The Good Plague is a party game to have fun with friends and family, taking place in an imaginary medieval kingdom contaminated by the plague.<br><br>Play as one of four characters desperately trying to flee the country : <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The Bard<br></li><li>The Thief<br></li><li>The Plague Doctor<br></li><li>The Warrior</li></ul><br>Everyone has his own backstory, perks and disadvantages to aid during the game.<br><br>In order to win, you wil